The code in this directory (models/, utils/) is adapted from the INSID3
reference implementation (in-context segmentation with a frozen DINOv3
encoder), distributed under the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Modifications in this repository:
- models/insid3.py: the encoder is put in eval mode before the positional
  debiasing basis is computed, so the basis is deterministic across processes.
- utils/clustering.py: split_disconnected_clusters() splits each cluster into
  its spatially connected pieces.

The wrapper in unboxed/insid3/__init__.py (model loading, prototypes and
per-tile clustering) is part of this repository.
